          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The read-only review found a transaction created after the September period entered Pending Close:\n\n- **Work order:** WO-2025-09-004 — MO-25-09-1070 (Cooler Plate Pack)\n- **Source transaction:** TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070 (component issue)\n- **Amount:** $284,763.42 USD\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30 19:15:00\n- **Pending Close entered:** 2025-09-30 18:00:00\n- **How late:** 75 minutes\n- **Recorded accounting status:** POSTED\n\n**Conclusion:** The status is not consistent with Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B’s documented Pending Close treatment. Newly created transactions that fall in or before the period are not processed while it is in Pending Close; this component issue is not among the stated exceptions. The report was submitted and verified.",
